---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

// GATED PAGE — behind the portal session cookie. This is the ONLY place on the
// site where the seller legal entity and its brand contact appear.
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Sale, IP Indemnification & Liability Waiver (Portal)"
  path="/portal/legal/terms-of-sale/"
  noindex={true}
  description="Binding B2B stocklot terms of sale — confidential, portal only."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-red-400/40 bg-red-400/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-300">
      Confidential — do not share
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">
      B2B Stocklot Terms of Sale, Intellectual Property Indemnification, and Liability Waiver
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-slate-300">工厂余量与品牌转让库存 B2B 销售、知识产权免责及质量合规协议</p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-100">Seller / Exporter / 卖方及出口方</p>
      <p class="mt-2"><strong class="text-slate-100">DONGJILIAN CO., LTD.</strong></p>
      <p>Address: Qingdao, Shandong Province, China, 266600</p>
      <p>Contact: <a class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200" href="mailto:toby@aquafarer.com">toby@aquafarer.com</a> | +86 13305324192</p>
      <p>Port of Loading: Qingdao Port (CNQDG), China</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <strong class="text-slate-100">Applicability / 适用范围：</strong> This binding legal document applies to all
      sales allocations, proforma invoices (PI), purchase orders, and container deliveries of inflatable stand-up
      paddleboard (SUP) factory surplus, cancelled order inventories, and liquidation lots executed between
      DONGJILIAN CO., LTD. (hereinafter "Seller") and the purchasing commercial entity, wholesaler, distributor, or
      broker (hereinafter "Buyer").
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">1. Nature of Goods &amp; "AS-IS" Commercial Sale <span class="text-slate-400">/ 标的物性质与现状销售原则</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">1.1 Commercial Stocklot Definition / 尾货定义</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">All inflatable SUP units covered by this transaction represent new, unused factory production overruns, cancelled brand shipments, or unclaimed inventory lots. Units are offered strictly on a commercial B2B surplus allocation basis at distressed, closeout commercial pricing.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">1.2 "AS-IS, WHERE-IS" Condition / 现状交付</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Except as expressly set forth in Section 2 herein, all goods, accessories, packages, and materials are sold <strong class="text-slate-100">"AS-IS, WHERE-IS, WITH ALL FAULTS"</strong> without retail warranty, after-sales service obligations, or consumer-level replacement coverage from the original commissioning brand owner or the Seller.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">1.3 Disclaimer of Implied Warranties / 排除默示保证</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Seller expressly disclaims all statutory and implied warranties, including but not limited to the implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular commercial purpose, quiet enjoyment, and non-infringement in destination jurisdictions, to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">2. Quality Verification &amp; Airtightness Acceptance <span class="text-slate-400">/ 质量保证与保压检验标准</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">2.1 Factory QC Testing Protocol / 出厂气密性检测规范</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Seller covenants that 100% of the inflatable SUP boards delivered have undergone and passed the factory airtightness control protocol (WI-QC-AT-001 Rev A):</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          <li>Inflation pressure: 15.0 to 18.0 PSI (1.03 to 1.24 Bar).</li>
          <li>Holding duration: 72 continuous hours in the Qingdao facility inspection hall.</li>
          <li>Permissible pressure drop: Delta-P ≤ 0.05 Bar (corrected for ambient warehouse temperature fluctuations).</li>
          <li>Seam and valve integrity: dual-layer perimeter weld, drop-stitch core, and valve seating verified free of structural bubbles or deformation.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">2.2 Pre-Shipment Inspection Rights / 买方终验权利</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Buyer is fully entitled and encouraged to inspect all goods prior to container stuffing at the Seller's Qingdao warehouse, either directly through the Buyer's authorized staff or via an internationally accredited third-party inspection agency (e.g., SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland).</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">2.3 Finality of Warehouse Sign-Off / 现场签收即最终交付</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Execution of the Pre-Shipment Inspection Release Summary, execution of the bill of lading handover, or issuance of payment for the final dispatch invoice shall constitute the Buyer's absolute, irrevocable acceptance of the physical and mechanical condition of the goods. No claims for cosmetic discrepancies, rail marks, EVA discoloration, or packaging scuffs will be honored after cargo gate-in at Qingdao Port.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">3. Intellectual Property &amp; Resale Restrictions <span class="text-slate-400">/ 知识产权合规与转售限制</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">3.1 Acknowledgment of Brand Rights / 品牌权益知悉</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Buyer expressly acknowledges that the inventory may incorporate proprietary logos, registered trademarks, exterior graphics, or patented fin-box/valve configurations belonging to original third-party brand owners. Neither the Seller nor the Buyer holds retail license rights on behalf of said original brand owners.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">3.2 Territorial and Channel Exclusions / 核心市场转售禁令</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Buyer strictly covenants, warrants, and agrees that:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          <li>The purchased goods shall <strong class="text-slate-100">NOT</strong> be advertised, marketed, or distributed through public retail channels within the original brand's home market jurisdictions (specifically the United States, Germany, France, the United Kingdom, and Australia), nor offered on closed global marketplaces (including Amazon, eBay, and Kaufland) under the original trademark names.</li>
          <li>Target distribution shall strictly focus on private rental fleets, closed club operations, tour centers, off-price wholesale jobber networks, or unbranded domestic resale outside the excluded territories.</li>
          <li>When required by regional customs or trademark authorities, the Buyer assumes sole responsibility for de-branding, neutral relabeling, carton over-stickering, or replacement of branding inserts.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">3.3 Strict Buyer Indemnification / 买方完全赔偿保证</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The Buyer shall defend, indemnify, and hold harmless DONGJILIAN CO., LTD., its directors, officers, agents, and manufacturing affiliates against any and all claims, civil lawsuits, administrative seizures, trademark infringement actions (including U.S. Lanham Act claims, DMCA notices, or European border measures), statutory fines, damages, settlements, and legal fees arising out of:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          <li>The Buyer's breach of territorial resale restrictions.</li>
          <li>The Buyer's downstream advertising, marketing, or unauthorized use of original brand intellectual property.</li>
          <li>Customs seizures or import blocks initiated by border authorities at destination discharge ports.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">4. Packaging, Accessories, and Neutrality <span class="text-slate-400">/ 包装、配件与中性化处理</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">4.1 Master Carton De-identification / 外箱中性化规范</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Unless explicitly ordered in original master cartons upon Buyer's written assumption of risk, all goods shall be packed in neutral 5-ply corrugated master cartons (Brown Neutral Box / Export Grade) without original brand barcodes (UPC/EAN), dealer addresses, or brand warranty URLs.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">4.2 Accessory Compatibility / 配件合规与标准</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Accessories included (double-action hand pumps, aluminum/fiberglass paddles, ankle leashes, repair canisters, and travel backpacks) are supplied as matched functional equipment sets. The Seller does not warrant that third-party retail branded manuals, regional safety certificates (e.g., California Prop 65 warning labels, CE DOC printouts), or retail warranty registration cards are present. The Buyer is solely responsible for verifying that documentation accompanying the kits meets destination import standards.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">5. Delivery, Title, and Risk of Loss <span class="text-slate-400">/ 交付、物权转移与风险承担</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">5.1 Incoterms Rules / 贸易术语</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">All quotations and shipments operate strictly under <strong class="text-slate-100">FOB Qingdao (Incoterms 2020)</strong> or <strong class="text-slate-100">EXW Qingdao Warehouse</strong>, as designated on the individual Proforma Invoice.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">5.2 Transfer of Risk / 风险转移节点</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Risk of loss, damage, container condensation, marine dampness, transit pressure fluctuations, and cargo pilferage transfers entirely to the Buyer once the container passes the ship's rail at Qingdao Port (for FOB sales) or upon handover to the Buyer's nominated carrier/forwarder at the factory warehouse door (for EXW sales).</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">5.3 Marine Cargo Insurance / 海运保险义务</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Under FOB terms, the Buyer is solely responsible for procuring Ocean Marine Cargo Insurance (Institute Cargo Clauses A or All Risks) covering 110% of the CIF value from port of loading to destination doors.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">6. Payment, Allocation Lock, and Default <span class="text-slate-400">/ 结算条款与定金违约责任</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">6.1 Deposit and Inventory Allocation / 定金与货源锁定</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">A non-refundable commercial deposit of 30% to 50% (as stated on the Proforma Invoice) via Telegraphic Transfer (T/T) is required to lock and reserve the designated stocklot allocation.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">6.2 Inspection and Balance Settlement / 终款结算期限</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The remaining balance must be received in full via T/T prior to container dispatch or against the surrender of the Original Bill of Lading (B/L) copy, as agreed in writing.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">6.3 Default and Forfeiture Protocol / 违约转卖与定金没收</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">If the Buyer fails to conduct inspection, pay the outstanding balance, or provide confirmed shipping instructions within 15 calendar days from the date the allocation is marked ready for loading:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          <li>The deposit paid shall be irrevocably forfeited to DONGJILIAN CO., LTD. as liquidated damages and compensation for warehouse stowage costs.</li>
          <li>The Seller reserves the unrestricted legal right to cancel the allocation, unreserve the boards, and resell the inventory to third-party commercial buyers without further judicial notice.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">7. Limitation of Liability <span class="text-slate-400">/ 责任上限与间接损失免除</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">7.1 Financial Cap on Liability / 赔偿总额上限</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">In no event shall the total aggregate liability of DONGJILIAN CO., LTD. for any claim, breach, negligence, or defective board issue under this agreement exceed the actual purchase amount paid by the Buyer for the specific defective individual unit(s) proved to have failed pre-existing airtightness standards.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">7.2 Exclusion of Consequential Losses / 排除衍生与间接损失</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Under no legal theory (contract, tort, product liability, or indemnity) shall the Seller be liable for loss of profits, loss of anticipated revenue, loss of business reputation, warehouse demurrage, shipping line detention, dead-freight charges, or incidental/consequential punitive damages.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">8. Dispute Resolution &amp; Governing Law <span class="text-slate-400">/ 适用法律与仲裁管辖</span></h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">8.1 Governing Law / 准据法</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">This agreement, its interpretation, and all sales arising hereunder shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the People's Republic of China, excluding the United Nations Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods (CISG).</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-slate-200">8.2 Binding Arbitration / 争议仲裁解决</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Any dispute, controversy, or claim arising out of or relating to this contract, including its formation, validity, breach, or termination, shall be submitted to the <strong class="text-slate-100">China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission (CIETAC) Shandong Sub-Commission</strong> in Qingdao for arbitration in accordance with CIETAC's arbitration rules in effect at the time of applying for arbitration. The arbitral award shall be final, binding upon both parties, and enforceable in any court of competent international jurisdiction.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">9. Execution &amp; Commercial Acknowledgment <span class="text-slate-400">/ 签署与商业确认</span></h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-300">By signing below, checking the verification acknowledgment box on the secure order portal, or issuing payment against an associated Proforma Invoice, the authorized commercial representative confirms having read, understood, and agreed to all provisions above.</p>

        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-100">For and on behalf of Seller:</p>
            <p class="mt-2 font-bold text-slate-100">DONGJILIAN CO., LTD.</p>
            <p class="mt-3">Authorized Signature: ______________________</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Title: Director of International Operations</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Location: Qingdao, China</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-100">For and on behalf of Buyer:</p>
            <p class="mt-3">Commercial Entity Name: ______________________</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Registration / Tax ID: ______________________</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Target Destination Country: ______________________</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Authorized Signature: ______________________</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Printed Name / Title: ______________________</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
      <a href="/portal/" class="text-sm text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">← Back to the inventory portal</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
